# This repo is dependency-free by design (see CLAUDE.md: "no build step, no
# test framework, no linter, and no dependencies"), so there is deliberately
# very little here. Every entry is something a tool drops in the working tree
# that would otherwise be committed by a plain `git add -A`.

# CLAUDE.md's own "Verifying changes" section tells you to install Playwright
# with `npm install --no-save` to drive the Admin tab in a headless browser,
# and to delete node_modules afterwards. Until this file existed, forgetting
# that second step meant committing a few hundred MB of dependencies to a
# repo whose whole premise is having none — and one already large enough that
# every workflow now checks out blobless and sparse to avoid its weight.
node_modules/

# Vercel CLI scratch state (project linkage, local build output). The real
# deployment is driven from the Vercel side; nothing here belongs in git.
.vercel/

# macOS Finder metadata. The site's static art is edited on a Mac (see
# mfl/PSD), so these turn up inside image directories rather than at the root.
.DS_Store
